flowchart LR
  Browser["User Browser"]
  Web["Flightr.Web<br/>(Razor Pages)"]
  API["Flightr.Api<br/>(REST API, Identity)"]
  DB["MySQL<br/>(Flightr database via EF Core)"]

  Browser -->|View pages / click UI| Web
  Web -->|Server-rendered pages / AJAX| API
  Browser -->|Login/Register POST| API
  API -->|Issues JWT on successful login| Browser
  Browser -->|Sends Bearer token on API calls| API
  API -->|Reads/writes data via EF Core| DB

